    "updated_at": "2024-03-15T14:32:08Z",
    "body": "Sections to upstream:\r\n\r\n- [ ] https://w3c.github.io/trusted-types/dist/spec/#extensions-to-the-windoworworkerglobalscope-interface - Not upstreaming as I don't think it's the norm to.\r\n- [x] https://w3c.github.io/trusted-types/dist/spec/#enforcement-in-document-interface\r\n- [x] https://w3c.github.io/trusted-types/dist/spec/#enforcement-in-domparser-interface\r\n- [x] https://w3c.github.io/trusted-types/dist/spec/#enforcement-in-element-shadowroot-interfaces\r\n- [x] https://w3c.github.io/trusted-types/dist/spec/#html-workers\r\n\r\n- [-] https://w3c.github.io/trusted-types/dist/spec/#enforcement-in-sinks - Only HTMLIframeElement srcdoc upstreamed\r\n- [ ] https://w3c.github.io/trusted-types/dist/spec/#enforcement-in-scripts - Still WIP so not upstreaming yet\r\n- [ ] https://w3c.github.io/trusted-types/dist/spec/#enforcement-in-timer-functions - Still WIP so not upstreaming yet\r\n- [ ] https://w3c.github.io/trusted-types/dist/spec/#enforcement-in-event-handler-content-attributes - Still WIP so not upstreaming yet\r\n- [ ] https://w3c.github.io/trusted-types/dist/spec/#html-validate-the-string-in-context - Will be upstreamed as a separate PR",
